text lho0 "<section class=\"now-section now-op-section\" id=\"operator\" aria-labelledby=\"now-op-h\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"kicker\">On the operator's desk</p><h2 id=\"now-op-h\" class=\"now-h2\">Decisions Drake is making</h2><p class=\"now-sub\">Work that cannot move until a human answers. Each line names the answer it needs.</p><div class=\"now-grid\">"
text lhm0 "<section class=\"now-section\" id=\"streams\" aria-labelledby=\"now-streams-h\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"kicker\">In motion</p><h2 id=\"now-streams-h\" class=\"now-h2\">What the agents are doing</h2><p class=\"now-sub\">Lines written in the last day, grouped by stream. The bar under each name is the stream's pulse: one segment per line, bright when written in the last half hour, fading as it cools.</p>"
text lhm1 "<p class=\"now-empty\">No line in motion was written in the last day.</p>"
text lhm2 "<div class=\"now-stream\" id=\"stream-"
