text lhqs0 "<section class=\"now-section\" id=\"quiet\" aria-labelledby=\"now-quiet-h\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"kicker\">Quiet</p><h2 id=\"now-quiet-h\" class=\"now-h2\">Open, not written in the last day</h2><p class=\"now-sub\">Still open, with an owner and notes, but nobody has written to them for over a day. Folded by stream; open a stream to read every line and its latest note.</p><div class=\"now-folds\">"
